WEBVTT

01:30.800 --> 01:34.520
=Lady Liberty=

01:35.020 --> 01:37.940
=Episode 5=

01:37.980 --> 01:39.980
(Dingqi Reading Platform)

01:39.980 --> 01:40.780
Mr. Fan.

01:44.700 --> 01:45.700
Looking for Gu Yan?

01:47.180 --> 01:48.860
I can only give you
the official response.

01:49.580 --> 01:51.620
I can pass on a message for you.

01:52.100 --> 01:53.700
But as for meeting in person...

01:55.300 --> 01:57.100
Gu Yan isn't taking visitors right now.

01:57.540 --> 01:58.060
Mr. Fan,

01:58.540 --> 02:01.044
authors are supposed to come in
for a weekly briefing.

02:01.380 --> 02:02.300
When is he coming in?

02:03.060 --> 02:04.700
Can't I just get a glimpse of him

02:04.700 --> 02:05.370
from a distance?

02:05.370 --> 02:07.010
He was just here yesterday afternoon.

02:07.010 --> 02:07.740
He won't be back

02:07.740 --> 02:09.660
for another week.

02:10.900 --> 02:11.700
We're setting up

02:11.700 --> 02:12.580
a live chat

02:12.580 --> 02:14.060
between Gu Yan and the readers soon.

02:14.220 --> 02:16.220
I'll let you know
when the stream goes live, okay?

02:43.500 --> 02:44.540
That flash drive has

02:44.540 --> 02:46.580
all the archival photos
I found for the author.

02:46.740 --> 02:48.140
It took me a month in the library

02:48.140 --> 02:49.180
to put that together.

02:49.500 --> 02:50.620
If I can't find it,

02:51.100 --> 02:52.300
I'll have to start over again.

02:52.555 --> 02:53.780
Could you check the elevator's

02:53.780 --> 02:55.140
security footage from yesterday?

02:55.140 --> 02:56.500
See if anyone picked it up.

03:07.820 --> 03:09.020
Could you rewind

03:09.020 --> 03:09.888
that part for me?

03:11.060 --> 03:12.100
What about the flash drive?

03:14.420 --> 03:14.940
That guy

03:14.940 --> 03:16.444
looks like an old friend of mine.

03:16.620 --> 03:17.500
Look, Miss.

03:17.860 --> 03:19.300
You're looking for a flash drive.

03:19.600 --> 03:22.177
I'm not showing the footage
so you could find your friends.

03:22.300 --> 03:23.260
If you don't see it,

03:23.260 --> 03:24.140
I'm turning this off.

03:30.580 --> 03:31.620
Lin Zhanqiao...

03:33.660 --> 03:35.380
This Gu Yan seems like a rookie.

03:35.660 --> 03:37.980
Probably around twenty-four or five.

03:38.580 --> 03:40.220
He's not among the authors I know.

03:40.260 --> 03:41.500
(Executive Director's Office)

03:41.500 --> 03:41.980
Also...

03:42.820 --> 03:43.620
he and Lin Zhanqiao

03:43.620 --> 03:45.466
showed up at Dingqi
around the same time.

03:48.020 --> 03:50.140
If Chenxing doesn't have
a new ace up their sleeve,

03:51.100 --> 03:52.420
why would they let He Han

03:52.580 --> 03:53.420
and Hong Qigong go?

04:02.740 --> 04:03.100
Mantou.

04:04.220 --> 04:05.340
I'm meeting an author today.

04:05.660 --> 04:06.511
I'm leaving early.

04:06.820 --> 04:07.940
What about Hong Qigong?

04:08.300 --> 04:09.980
She says she has a high fever

04:09.980 --> 04:10.580
and brain fog.

04:10.860 --> 04:11.620
She's on leave.

04:12.020 --> 04:13.220
Tell her to get plenty of rest.

04:13.580 --> 04:14.450
If she's not worried,

04:14.450 --> 04:15.260
we're not worried.

04:15.540 --> 04:16.140
We don't have

04:16.140 --> 04:17.820
another top-tier author to replace her.

04:17.820 --> 04:18.890
When the rankings come out,

04:18.980 --> 04:20.060
it will look bad for us.

04:20.220 --> 04:21.220
Begging her is worse.

04:31.780 --> 04:32.540
I don't want this.

04:32.860 --> 04:34.300
Krug Champagne is on promotion today.

04:34.500 --> 04:35.511
It's an absolute steal.

04:35.780 --> 04:37.220
Even Yi Shu wrote about it.

04:37.311 --> 04:39.600
She said if she were rich,
she would spend all her money

04:39.666 --> 04:40.755
on Krug Champagne.

04:40.860 --> 04:42.020
It's just that popular.

04:44.940 --> 04:49.700
(Year 2021)

04:51.260 --> 04:54.180
- He Han!
- He Han!

04:54.460 --> 05:04.660
- He Han!
- He Han!

05:16.700 --> 05:17.380
Here's to us.

05:17.380 --> 05:18.820
To us!

05:18.820 --> 05:19.820
(Year 2023)

05:19.820 --> 05:20.180
Cheers.

05:20.340 --> 05:21.500
Congratulations, Ms. Lin.

05:21.860 --> 05:23.220
Congratulations to you, superstar.

05:39.300 --> 05:40.380
Any other recommendations?

05:40.700 --> 05:41.060
Yes.

05:41.580 --> 05:43.700
We have another champagne here.

05:44.620 --> 05:45.540
But the price

05:45.540 --> 05:46.980
is about the same as the Krug

05:46.980 --> 05:47.860
with today's discount.

05:48.060 --> 05:48.460
Do you...

05:48.780 --> 05:49.980
Thanks for the recommendation.

05:50.022 --> 05:50.860
I'll take this one.

05:51.060 --> 05:51.540
Alright.

05:51.700 --> 05:52.820
I'll bag it for you.

06:05.540 --> 06:05.940
Hello?

06:05.940 --> 06:06.700
Ms. Lin?

06:06.940 --> 06:07.820
I'm your neighbor.

06:08.220 --> 06:09.380
Your mother is at your door.

06:09.380 --> 06:10.420
She passed out from hunger.

06:11.088 --> 06:12.340
I'm on my way. Thank you.

06:26.020 --> 06:26.700
Ms. Lin.

06:27.060 --> 06:28.340
Your mom has been waiting

06:28.340 --> 06:30.220
at your door since this afternoon.

06:30.860 --> 06:32.140
The old lady can't handle that.

06:32.460 --> 06:33.300
I'm fine.

06:33.380 --> 06:34.220
She's busy with work.

06:34.220 --> 06:35.700
It's normal for me to wait.

06:36.460 --> 06:38.180
Next time, I'll just bring some candy

06:38.180 --> 06:39.220
or cookies with me.

06:39.355 --> 06:40.060
Thank you so much.

06:40.060 --> 06:40.660
Are you okay?

06:40.780 --> 06:41.140
I'm fine.

06:41.266 --> 06:41.880
Open the door.

06:41.980 --> 06:42.820
I'm so sorry, Madam.

06:42.820 --> 06:43.844
Thanks for taking care of her.

06:43.860 --> 06:45.220
It was a miscommunication on our part.

06:45.220 --> 06:47.210
You're so busy,
and neglecting your own mother?

06:47.220 --> 06:48.540
Good thing I saw her today.

06:48.740 --> 06:49.620
If I hadn't,

06:49.780 --> 06:51.090
low blood sugar could be fatal.

06:51.090 --> 06:51.980
- It's not that serious.
- You know what I mean.

06:52.060 --> 06:52.700
Thank you.

06:53.420 --> 06:53.820
Thanks.

06:54.022 --> 06:54.540
Come on in.

06:57.300 --> 06:58.100
I'm sorry.

06:58.100 --> 06:59.140
I interrupted your work.

06:59.380 --> 07:00.980
You still had things to do, right?

07:01.500 --> 07:03.340
Why don't you go ahead and finish up?

07:03.980 --> 07:04.620
I'll just...

07:05.180 --> 07:06.140
I'll wait for you here.

07:08.020 --> 07:09.540
Didn't I tell you on the phone

07:09.540 --> 07:11.540
that I'd be working really late today?

07:12.100 --> 07:13.340
I told you not to wait for me,

07:13.340 --> 07:14.777
that you could come another day.

07:15.820 --> 07:17.660
I got these vegetables and meat.

07:17.980 --> 07:19.500
It's your father's birthday on Monday,

07:19.820 --> 07:21.940
so I had to get the food ready anyway.

07:22.700 --> 07:24.220
They wouldn't fit in my fridge,

07:24.540 --> 07:26.420
so I brought them over
and put them in yours.

07:27.066 --> 07:29.244
I could make
a couple of dishes for you, too.

07:29.460 --> 07:31.180
So you'd have food after work.

07:37.820 --> 07:38.980
You could've just

07:38.980 --> 07:40.380
bought these groceries on Monday.

07:40.740 --> 07:43.060
You can get this stuff

07:43.260 --> 07:44.740
at the supermarket anytime.

07:45.260 --> 07:45.700
Plus,

07:45.700 --> 07:47.330
I barely ever cook at home.

07:47.330 --> 07:49.100
I rarely eat here anyway,

07:49.580 --> 07:50.700
so no need to cook for me.

07:51.860 --> 07:53.260
What if you get hungry at night?

07:54.100 --> 07:56.180
Takeout isn't as healthy
as a home-cooked meal.

07:57.740 --> 07:58.740
Okay, I get it.

07:58.740 --> 07:59.700
I won't do it next time.

08:00.300 --> 08:02.333
Go ahead and do your thing.
Don't worry about me.

08:02.340 --> 08:03.820
I'll leave as soon as I'm done.

08:05.155 --> 08:07.244
Let me put
those flowers in a vase for you.

08:07.540 --> 08:08.380
No, that's okay.

08:08.700 --> 08:09.940
I bought them for a friend.

08:31.460 --> 08:32.140
Hello, Ms. Lin.

08:32.420 --> 08:33.940
I won't be coming to see you today.

08:34.020 --> 08:35.140
Something came up at home.

08:35.540 --> 08:36.660
We'll talk tomorrow.

08:37.380 --> 08:37.940
Also,

08:38.155 --> 08:40.444
send me the updated draft
as soon as it's done.

08:40.740 --> 08:41.860
Okay, got it.

09:23.220 --> 09:24.140
Have you had dinner?

09:24.700 --> 09:25.660
I already ate.

09:25.844 --> 09:26.660
Have some fruit, then.

09:26.820 --> 09:27.740
No, I'm good.

09:32.340 --> 09:33.140
(My parents)

09:33.660 --> 09:34.980
(are gentle, kind people.)

09:36.460 --> 09:38.020
(We truly care for)

09:38.688 --> 09:39.660
(and love each other.)

09:41.088 --> 09:42.020
(But we still struggle)

09:42.020 --> 09:43.620
(to find a comfortable level of intimacy)

09:43.620 --> 09:44.460
(that works for us.)

09:46.380 --> 09:48.260
(Do picture-perfect families)

09:49.620 --> 09:50.380
(actually exist?)

09:52.540 --> 09:53.460
(Or are there always)

09:55.420 --> 09:56.500
(hidden flaws?)

10:15.622 --> 10:17.066
(Colorful Culture Media)
Why haven't you left yet?

10:19.533 --> 10:21.450
You were handling matters
outside all by yourself.

10:21.460 --> 10:23.200
It'd be unconscionable
for me to just leave.

10:25.020 --> 10:26.300
Even though you act like a jerk

10:26.300 --> 10:27.020
most of the time,

10:27.420 --> 10:28.220
your diligence

10:28.420 --> 10:30.066
is your one redeeming quality at work.

10:31.180 --> 10:32.540
You can talk business with me only.

10:33.500 --> 10:34.660
I'm much better at business

10:34.940 --> 10:36.340
than relationships.

10:36.820 --> 10:37.620
That's no fun.

10:43.300 --> 10:44.060
I'm starving.

10:48.260 --> 10:49.220
Are you sure Gu Yan

10:49.340 --> 10:50.260
isn't with Dingqi?

10:51.620 --> 10:52.020
Positive.

10:52.580 --> 10:53.780
If he works for Lin Zhanqiao,

10:54.380 --> 10:55.140
we won't be getting

10:55.977 --> 10:57.088
Zhiyuan's money.

11:00.740 --> 11:01.800
You could always go back.

11:03.340 --> 11:04.460
Just tell Lin Zhanqiao

11:05.200 --> 11:06.380
you were blinded by love.

11:07.100 --> 11:08.600
But you've calmed down and are ready

11:09.100 --> 11:09.980
to be with her.

11:10.400 --> 11:12.066
If you're short on cash, I have some.

11:13.180 --> 11:14.220
We're in the same boat.

11:16.260 --> 11:16.866
Never mind.

11:17.380 --> 11:18.460
I don't work for you.

11:19.420 --> 11:21.020
I want this to be our company.

11:34.020 --> 11:34.860
Only beer today.

11:36.860 --> 11:37.620
But trust me.

11:38.620 --> 11:39.860
Once the company takes off,

11:40.540 --> 11:41.600
and I'm doing better,

11:42.500 --> 11:43.700
I'll buy some good wine

11:45.180 --> 11:46.100
and have a nice drink.

11:50.620 --> 11:52.500
I know this sudden romance

11:52.500 --> 11:53.220
isn't for me.

11:54.060 --> 11:54.860
It's for Gu Yan.

11:57.140 --> 11:58.300
But I'm still happy.

12:00.420 --> 12:01.260
At least, you know

12:01.260 --> 12:02.260
I'm useful to you.

12:03.100 --> 12:03.660
That's why

12:03.660 --> 12:05.220
you spend time trying to please me.

12:06.820 --> 12:07.180
Right?

12:13.580 --> 12:14.066
Come on.

12:32.700 --> 12:33.244
Zhao Lanxin.

12:34.820 --> 12:35.380
I'm single.

12:35.820 --> 12:37.140
If you need a fake boyfriend

12:38.100 --> 12:38.900
to start a company,

12:39.780 --> 12:40.980
take photos, post online,

12:40.980 --> 12:42.220
and stroke your ego,

12:42.340 --> 12:42.900
that's fine.

12:44.300 --> 12:45.020
But in private,

12:45.020 --> 12:46.100
drop the act.

12:47.300 --> 12:48.540
I have no interest in dating.

12:49.780 --> 12:51.460
If there's no profit in it,

12:52.060 --> 12:52.900
I won't please anyone.

12:53.780 --> 12:54.420
Not even women.

12:55.220 --> 12:56.820
All relationships are transactional.

12:57.500 --> 12:58.340
On that point,

12:58.780 --> 12:59.700
we agree.

13:03.540 --> 13:04.980
I've got writer's block.

13:06.220 --> 13:07.890
If the female lead gets humiliated

13:07.890 --> 13:09.300
by the salon manager,

13:09.460 --> 13:10.660
what should the male lead do?

13:11.060 --> 13:12.220
The salon is full of women.

13:12.700 --> 13:14.540
He can't just beat someone up

13:14.540 --> 13:16.060
like at the hot pot place.

13:18.140 --> 13:19.620
Just have him buy

13:19.620 --> 13:21.460
the salon.

13:22.300 --> 13:23.140
Fire the manager

13:23.460 --> 13:24.420
and make her the boss.

13:26.060 --> 13:28.020
If she's the boss,

13:28.220 --> 13:30.180
the latter plot
will be too hard for her.

13:30.740 --> 13:32.260
She's too pure and kind.

13:32.420 --> 13:33.820
The staff would also bully her.

13:34.688 --> 13:35.780
Then, have the male lead

13:35.780 --> 13:37.580
interview the staff himself.

13:37.580 --> 13:38.700
Reject the smart ones.

13:38.700 --> 13:40.780
Only keep those purer than her.

13:42.020 --> 13:43.690
It doesn't matter if it runs well.

13:43.690 --> 13:45.060
As long as she's happy.

13:46.900 --> 13:48.740
And she still won't marry him?

13:49.260 --> 13:50.180
Not yet.

13:50.180 --> 13:51.340
She'll agree at the end.

13:52.340 --> 13:53.140
Plus, the male lead

13:53.140 --> 13:54.820
isn't the type to force marriage.

13:55.220 --> 13:56.460
He'll wait until she's ready

13:56.460 --> 13:58.140
and willing before he asks.

14:10.820 --> 14:12.180
Is that what you think too?

14:12.580 --> 14:13.580
Are you waiting

14:14.220 --> 14:15.260
for my "I do"?

14:15.340 --> 14:16.820
I'm not.

14:17.100 --> 14:17.940
Definitely not.

14:18.900 --> 14:19.460
I am the type

14:19.460 --> 14:20.820
to force marriage.

14:21.060 --> 14:22.020
So if I haven't asked,

14:22.020 --> 14:23.300
I haven't thought about it.

14:25.620 --> 14:27.260
Go update your chapter.

14:27.780 --> 14:28.140
Be good.

14:29.220 --> 14:30.020
So you're staying up

14:30.020 --> 14:31.140
to wait for my update?

14:31.300 --> 14:32.860
Yes, that's the case.

14:33.660 --> 14:34.340
I'll get to it.

14:34.980 --> 14:35.700
Wait for me.

14:42.060 --> 14:43.740
(Gu Yan's "Drunk Old Friend" updated.)

14:43.940 --> 14:44.740
(Drunk Old Friend)

14:44.740 --> 14:45.460
(Start Reading)

14:48.340 --> 14:53.700
(Chapter 63: The Dance Mystery III)

14:55.500 --> 14:56.900
Don't fall asleep.

14:56.900 --> 14:57.900
I'm updating soon.

14:58.020 --> 14:58.980
Another 20 minutes.

14:59.220 --> 14:59.940
It'll be ready.

15:06.660 --> 15:09.020
(Select Tip Amount)

15:36.100 --> 15:36.860
I'm leaving.

15:36.860 --> 15:38.100
Take care of yourself.

15:38.540 --> 15:40.180
Don't work too hard.

15:40.660 --> 15:41.820
There's food in the fridge.

15:41.820 --> 15:44.100
Bring it to your dad soon.

16:18.780 --> 16:20.860
(For Lin)

16:20.860 --> 16:24.700
(For Monday morning,
expiring Tuesday afternoon.)

16:25.420 --> 16:26.540
Tomorrow at 10:30 AM,

16:26.620 --> 16:27.780
Gu Yan will have a livestream

16:27.780 --> 16:28.850
on Dingqi Reading Platform.

16:28.860 --> 16:29.540
I'll go early

16:29.620 --> 16:30.660
to try to chat with him.

16:30.860 --> 16:32.060
You won't get a chance there.

16:33.060 --> 16:34.620
Better to print out our terms

16:34.620 --> 16:35.780
and offers for him

16:36.020 --> 16:36.780
to read.

16:37.180 --> 16:37.980
They're all ready.

16:40.220 --> 16:41.970
So our priorities are...

16:41.970 --> 16:43.220
First, Gu Yan.

16:43.580 --> 16:44.460
Second, Hong Qigong.

16:45.180 --> 16:46.740
Third, Zhugan Dalang.

16:46.980 --> 16:48.140
We'll start with Lin Zhanqiao,

16:49.260 --> 16:50.620
and poach the talented rookies

16:51.180 --> 16:52.740
her editors are managing.

16:53.220 --> 16:54.060
The rookies?

16:54.700 --> 16:55.580
I already told them

16:55.580 --> 16:56.660
we're changing our terms.

16:57.022 --> 16:58.377
No more monthly salaries.

16:58.660 --> 17:00.020
Bonuses based on click tiers.

17:00.740 --> 17:01.780
A lot of them

17:01.780 --> 17:02.820
will struggle to live.

17:03.220 --> 17:04.020
That just proves

17:04.020 --> 17:05.311
they aren't meant for this.

17:05.700 --> 17:07.140
Why didn't you discuss this with me?

17:09.020 --> 17:10.140
If you land Gu Yan,

17:10.140 --> 17:11.700
would you even care

17:11.700 --> 17:12.780
how I deal with the rookies?

17:12.940 --> 17:14.300
You being so anxious now

17:14.300 --> 17:15.420
just proves that you can't

17:16.380 --> 17:16.820
land him.

17:17.900 --> 17:18.780
It's "us."

17:19.500 --> 17:20.780
This isn't just on me.

17:21.660 --> 17:22.500
Startups are hard.

17:22.711 --> 17:24.022
Survival of the fittest.

17:25.460 --> 17:26.820
If you can't deliver,

17:27.900 --> 17:30.380
I'll have to consider other partners.

17:39.940 --> 17:40.740
I'll walk you back.

17:41.460 --> 17:41.900
No need.

17:42.088 --> 17:43.300
I'm staying at my place today.

17:43.660 --> 17:44.580
It's across the street.

17:46.140 --> 17:46.900
I'll walk you over.

17:49.020 --> 17:49.340
Okay.

18:00.466 --> 18:01.866
I've always wanted to ask,

18:02.820 --> 18:05.020
why do you stay at Lin Zhanqiao's place

18:05.340 --> 18:06.540
instead of your own?

18:07.620 --> 18:09.700
Is her place closer to work?

18:11.140 --> 18:11.740
No.

18:12.980 --> 18:14.900
Traffic from her place is terrible.

18:16.400 --> 18:17.380
Then, are you afraid

18:18.260 --> 18:18.940
of being alone?

18:20.540 --> 18:21.060
Nope.

18:22.333 --> 18:24.244
You don't seem afraid of being alone.

18:27.180 --> 18:28.220
It's my mom's judgment.

18:29.140 --> 18:29.900
She's a neat freak.

18:30.900 --> 18:32.260
Every time before she comes over,

18:32.540 --> 18:33.620
I have to clean up.

18:34.220 --> 18:35.580
But it never meets her standards.

18:37.300 --> 18:38.260
So then I figured,

18:38.844 --> 18:40.820
if someone lives there,
it'll never be spotless.

18:41.177 --> 18:42.380
So I just don't stay there.

18:42.940 --> 18:43.860
It's now a showroom.

18:58.420 --> 19:01.740
♪First time in love♪

19:03.700 --> 19:07.260
♪It tears my heart apart♪

19:09.580 --> 19:12.700
♪Keep chasing on♪

19:14.780 --> 19:18.220
♪Yet no one will ever know♪

19:20.500 --> 19:23.820
♪For long time♪

19:26.140 --> 19:29.820
♪Hope to lean on your side♪

19:31.380 --> 19:34.940
♪And here you are♪

19:37.140 --> 19:40.220
♪Calling my name in the air♪

19:42.460 --> 19:46.180
♪Stay with open arms♪

19:53.140 --> 19:55.140
(Bestseller List)

19:55.140 --> 19:57.020
(Amnesia: My Bossy,
Love-Obsessed Husband)

19:59.780 --> 20:01.820
Mimi's Love-Obsessed Husband

20:01.820 --> 20:04.100
hit number one on the women's chart.

20:04.460 --> 20:05.380
That's great news.

20:05.620 --> 20:06.900
We should celebrate.

20:07.220 --> 20:09.340
("Completely hooked and can't stop")

20:09.420 --> 20:11.500
(is popping up all over the comments.)

20:11.777 --> 20:13.820
(Dingqi Livestream)
(Based on the current data,)

20:14.100 --> 20:16.580
(Drunk Old Friend
is gaining serious momentum.)

20:16.580 --> 20:19.540
I've never seen you
care so much about a rookie.

20:21.700 --> 20:23.500
I'm verifying your theory.

20:23.940 --> 20:24.980
What theory?

20:26.540 --> 20:28.700
That Gu Yan
is Lin Zhanqiao's secret weapon.

20:38.300 --> 20:41.140
(Online Fan Meet: Drunk Old Friend)

20:41.140 --> 20:44.540
(Hit Author: Gu Yan)

20:45.540 --> 20:47.380
Today, we are honored to invite

20:47.380 --> 20:48.740
the author himself, Gu Yan,

20:48.900 --> 20:50.780
and his talent scout editor

20:50.900 --> 20:52.060
to our livestream

20:52.260 --> 20:53.100
to meet everyone.

20:56.100 --> 20:56.820
Let Mr. Fan know

20:57.140 --> 20:57.844
Gu Yan is here.

21:24.420 --> 21:25.100
Lin Zhanqiao?

21:32.940 --> 21:33.380
Gu Yan?

21:38.780 --> 21:39.420
My author.

21:45.260 --> 21:45.740
Mr. Fan.

21:46.060 --> 21:46.540
Zhanqiao.

21:47.100 --> 21:49.020
We can finally
announce our collaboration.

21:50.180 --> 21:50.820
Young man.

21:51.660 --> 21:53.100
Your new update yesterday

21:53.420 --> 21:54.940
set another click record.

21:56.088 --> 21:57.177
It's very promising.

21:57.466 --> 21:57.940
Let's go.

21:58.100 --> 21:58.300
Come.

21:58.300 --> 21:59.000
Have a seat inside.

22:04.020 --> 22:05.260
Alright, book lovers,

22:05.340 --> 22:07.060
you can see who has joined

22:07.140 --> 22:08.111
our livestream today.

22:08.155 --> 22:10.460
We have the author himself, Gu Yan,

22:10.740 --> 22:13.260
and our star editor, Ms. Zhanqiao.

22:13.340 --> 22:14.420
(Welcome to both of you.)

22:17.300 --> 22:18.980
(So, Gu Yan, could you briefly)

22:18.980 --> 22:20.380
(introduce your background?)

22:32.940 --> 22:34.660
Gu Yan, may I ask

22:34.820 --> 22:36.311
what Zhanqiao whispered to you?

22:37.140 --> 22:37.660
She...

22:38.020 --> 22:38.980
She just told me

22:39.580 --> 22:41.100
to tell the truth.

22:41.860 --> 22:42.740
It was pretty cool.

22:43.060 --> 22:43.820
(As we all know,)

22:43.820 --> 22:46.220
(talent is common,
but a good scout is rare.)

22:46.700 --> 22:48.410
(Ms. Lin has a sharp eye)

22:48.410 --> 22:50.140
(and exceptional abilities.)

22:55.660 --> 22:56.980
You've grown, Lin Zhanqiao.

23:01.540 --> 23:02.340
Are you jealous?

23:03.100 --> 23:03.940
Why would I be?

23:04.540 --> 23:05.820
I'm happy for her.

23:05.820 --> 23:07.380
She finally found a good card to play.

23:09.060 --> 23:10.300
Lin Zhanqiao has been holding

23:10.300 --> 23:11.420
this card for a long time.

23:11.540 --> 23:12.620
At least

23:13.220 --> 23:14.060
half a year.

23:17.688 --> 23:18.820
Why are you looking at me?

23:20.660 --> 23:21.500
Now it seems

23:21.500 --> 23:22.820
this card is being used against

23:22.820 --> 23:24.500
Zhao Lanxin and Ling Yikai.

23:24.700 --> 23:26.180
But initially, it must have been

23:26.380 --> 23:27.620
to replace you.

23:28.100 --> 23:28.700
No surprise.

23:29.380 --> 23:30.500
I'm not exactly

23:30.500 --> 23:31.700
a cooperative author.

23:31.700 --> 23:33.220
She's wanted to replace me for a while.

23:33.540 --> 23:34.050
Of course,

23:34.050 --> 23:35.740
Gu Yan could never replace me.

23:36.820 --> 23:37.810
And Lin Zhanqiao

23:37.810 --> 23:39.200
doesn't have any confidence in him.

23:39.300 --> 23:40.800
Or she would've released this sooner.

23:41.260 --> 23:42.620
When Zhao Lanxin challenged her,

23:42.620 --> 23:43.940
she forced him into the spotlight.

23:52.340 --> 23:53.500
When did you find Gu Yan?

23:54.620 --> 23:55.500
It's been a while.

23:55.940 --> 23:57.300
I've never seen a contract for him.

23:57.666 --> 23:58.980
I haven't signed the contract yet.

24:00.260 --> 24:00.660
Why not?

24:01.044 --> 24:02.088
Guarding against us?

24:02.580 --> 24:03.540
You couldn't have known

24:03.540 --> 24:04.933
Ling Yikai and I were leaving.

24:05.060 --> 24:06.340
I'm not that clairvoyant.

24:08.420 --> 24:09.460
But after so long,

24:10.140 --> 24:11.260
I know the kind of person

24:11.260 --> 24:12.100
Ling Yikai is.

24:12.700 --> 24:13.380
He worked so hard

24:13.380 --> 24:14.780
to secure the Zhiyuan Investment,

24:15.500 --> 24:17.180
and kept me completely out of the loop.

24:18.220 --> 24:19.060
I had a feeling

24:19.060 --> 24:20.020
he'd negotiate with me.

24:24.980 --> 24:26.140
I was guarding against him.

24:26.980 --> 24:27.500
I didn't know

24:28.060 --> 24:28.740
you'd leave.

24:30.020 --> 24:30.780
Keeping it from me

24:30.780 --> 24:31.980
is guarding against me.

24:33.000 --> 24:34.900
Do you really think
Gu Yan can surpass He Han?

24:35.220 --> 24:35.900
It's up to him.

24:37.100 --> 24:38.620
At least he's surpassed Hong Qigong.

24:57.577 --> 24:59.020
Did you watch Gu Yan's livestream?

25:00.020 --> 25:01.140
Congratulations, Ms. Lin.

25:01.140 --> 25:02.740
Nice trick, keeping him hidden.

25:02.740 --> 25:04.044
But I'm a bit busy right now.

25:04.060 --> 25:04.900
I'm just heading out

25:04.900 --> 25:06.660
to celebrate Mimi hitting number one.

25:12.340 --> 25:14.060
(Honestly, Drunk Old Friend)

25:14.660 --> 25:16.060
(wouldn't be where it is today)

25:16.500 --> 25:18.660
(without my editor,)

25:18.980 --> 25:20.980
(also my boss, Ms. Lin.)

25:21.460 --> 25:22.620
Before I met her,

25:23.780 --> 25:25.940
I opened an internet cafe with a friend.

25:26.888 --> 25:28.580
I worked the night shift every night.

25:29.540 --> 25:30.540
When it got busy,

25:30.622 --> 25:32.760
(Mengtong Internet Cafe, Year 2023)
the new computers were taken.

25:32.760 --> 25:35.020
I could only
use the old ones to read web novels.

25:36.000 --> 25:37.140
After reading so many,

25:37.740 --> 25:38.820
I started writing my own.

25:40.340 --> 25:41.580
Ms. Lin discovered me.

25:43.020 --> 25:45.020
There was a line I wrote
in Drunk Old Friend.

25:45.700 --> 25:47.340
"Drunk, I miss the vast misty waters.

25:48.220 --> 25:50.060
Waking, my old friend's tea is still warm."

25:51.220 --> 25:53.220
This inscription in Drunk Old Friend

25:53.220 --> 25:54.555
was written for Lin Zhanqiao.

25:55.180 --> 25:56.380
I could even say

25:56.740 --> 25:58.540
that the entirety of Drunk Old Friend

25:58.780 --> 26:00.060
was written for Lin Zhanqiao.

26:00.620 --> 26:03.140
Just like how books always had

26:03.444 --> 26:05.380
"Dedicated to so-and-so"
on the title page.

26:05.466 --> 26:06.400
It's the same idea.

26:07.100 --> 26:08.540
Before I met Lin Zhanqiao,

26:08.577 --> 26:10.666
I was just
a night-shift internet cafe admin.

26:11.220 --> 26:12.140
In a basement,

26:12.620 --> 26:15.540
wearing headphones, smoking, swearing,
and eating instant noodles.

26:16.340 --> 26:18.180
Writing novels was just an outlet.

26:19.220 --> 26:21.420
Like daydreaming.

26:21.888 --> 26:23.688
(Annihilation Secret)
Dreaming of getting rich.

26:23.733 --> 26:25.311
(The Return of the Phantom Knight)
Dreaming of moving up.

26:25.460 --> 26:26.666
Dreaming of being a hero.

26:27.660 --> 26:29.300
I wouldn't even call them dreams.

26:29.940 --> 26:30.580
At best,

26:31.340 --> 26:32.460
they were delusions.

26:33.460 --> 26:34.940
Until Lin Zhanqiao found me.

26:36.380 --> 26:37.460
When I saw her,

26:38.380 --> 26:39.180
I felt like

26:39.940 --> 26:41.420
I had known her for a long time.

26:42.020 --> 26:42.700
Or rather,

26:43.666 --> 26:44.180
I felt like

26:44.180 --> 26:46.140
I was meant to wait here
for someone like her.

26:47.260 --> 26:48.220
To pick

26:48.888 --> 26:50.977
a piece of trash like me
out of the dumpster.

26:52.260 --> 26:53.740
To give me validation and support

26:53.820 --> 26:54.620
without disgust.

26:55.940 --> 26:56.820
In my whole life,

26:57.580 --> 26:58.300
no one has ever

26:58.300 --> 27:00.060
given me so much patience and time.

27:01.140 --> 27:02.820
If you like the story

27:03.460 --> 27:04.500
you are reading now,

27:05.500 --> 27:06.860
it's not because of Gu Yan.

27:07.800 --> 27:09.060
It's because of Lin Zhanqiao.

27:10.020 --> 27:11.540
All the praise and honors I receive

27:12.180 --> 27:13.140
in my past, present,

27:13.740 --> 27:15.740
and future,

27:16.740 --> 27:18.900
should first belong to Lin Zhanqiao.

27:20.100 --> 27:20.980
She taught me,

27:21.444 --> 27:22.380
and encouraged me.

27:23.340 --> 27:25.340
That's the only reason
you are able to read

27:26.300 --> 27:27.420
these chapters today.

27:37.660 --> 27:38.700
This place is nice.

27:38.780 --> 27:39.500
Of course.

27:39.740 --> 27:40.940
It's quite lively here.

27:41.660 --> 27:42.466
Let's sit there.

27:42.660 --> 27:42.980
Okay.

27:43.900 --> 27:44.700
Hello, Mr. He.

27:44.700 --> 27:45.340
I'm Zhangzhu,

27:45.540 --> 27:46.780
Ms. Lin's assistant at Chenxing.

27:47.180 --> 27:48.260
We met yesterday, right?

27:48.260 --> 27:48.900
Remember me?

27:48.900 --> 27:49.860
The number one fan.

27:49.860 --> 27:51.100
Yes, your fan.

27:51.620 --> 27:52.500
Hello, I'm Mimi.

27:53.180 --> 27:54.660
I'm He Han's girlfriend.

27:55.540 --> 27:57.140
Meeting a Love-Obsessed Husband.

27:57.266 --> 27:59.020
Congratulations
on hitting number one today.

27:59.300 --> 27:59.860
Thank you.

27:59.955 --> 28:00.620
You're welcome.

28:00.620 --> 28:01.400
Where's your boss?

28:01.740 --> 28:02.980
Livestreaming with Gu Yan.

28:02.980 --> 28:03.620
They'll be here.

28:03.900 --> 28:05.060
I came ahead to order.

28:05.380 --> 28:06.380
What a coincidence.

28:07.060 --> 28:08.340
Let's sit together, then.

28:09.933 --> 28:10.600
Together...

28:11.180 --> 28:11.940
Sit here?

28:12.380 --> 28:12.780
This...

28:12.940 --> 28:14.300
Is it inconvenient?

28:15.860 --> 28:16.340
This...

28:17.100 --> 28:18.000
What a coincidence.

28:21.340 --> 28:21.780
Ms. Lin.

28:22.220 --> 28:23.220
Mr. He is here

28:23.220 --> 28:25.100
to celebrate
his girlfriend's top ranking.

28:25.860 --> 28:26.780
Let me introduce you.

28:27.340 --> 28:27.780
Gu Yan.

28:28.660 --> 28:29.020
He Han.

28:29.860 --> 28:30.340
Zhangzhu.

28:30.940 --> 28:31.340
Mimi.

28:33.820 --> 28:34.700
Hello, Mr. He.

28:36.300 --> 28:37.140
Don't call me Mr. He.

28:37.300 --> 28:37.980
Call me senior.

28:38.420 --> 28:39.740
After all, our mutual mentor

28:39.740 --> 28:40.900
is Ms. Lin Zhanqiao.

28:41.380 --> 28:42.300
And let me tell you,

28:42.620 --> 28:44.020
I gave you this month

28:44.020 --> 28:45.860
so you could seize the opportunity

28:45.980 --> 28:46.940
to have a head start.

28:47.740 --> 28:50.044
Because Ms. Lin has been
having a run of bad luck lately.

28:50.100 --> 28:51.920
She can only rely on you
to boost her career.

28:52.380 --> 28:53.220
I'll do my best.

28:53.820 --> 28:55.420
But you're the ceiling in this industry.

28:55.820 --> 28:56.820
I'll learn from you.

28:57.420 --> 28:58.620
Don't stress yourself out.

28:59.500 --> 29:01.020
After all, I met He Han when he was

29:01.220 --> 29:02.220
in his early twenties.

29:02.700 --> 29:04.260
He wasn't even as good as you now.

29:05.420 --> 29:05.980
Of course.

29:06.940 --> 29:08.820
I was only twenty myself back then.

29:09.580 --> 29:10.460
As an editor,

29:10.660 --> 29:12.300
my experience
wasn't what it is now.

29:12.900 --> 29:13.900
Completely incompetent.

29:17.740 --> 29:20.140
Ms. Lin, should we
move to another table?

29:20.340 --> 29:22.180
Because it seems
He Han wants to sit here.

29:22.620 --> 29:23.660
I'm afraid it might be

29:23.660 --> 29:25.300
inconvenient when we talk business.

29:25.300 --> 29:26.100
No need.

29:26.180 --> 29:27.700
We'll leave. You guys chat here.

29:28.180 --> 29:29.700
Come, sit down.

29:30.020 --> 29:30.300
Sit.

29:31.540 --> 29:31.980
Enjoy.

29:33.740 --> 29:35.650
Excuse me. Please bring out our cake.

29:35.650 --> 29:36.180
Thank you.

29:44.140 --> 29:45.260
I need to record this.

29:47.740 --> 29:49.060
I want to film the finger heart.

29:49.180 --> 29:49.980
Yeah, like so.

29:50.540 --> 29:51.777
Put it together with mine.

29:58.700 --> 29:59.620
Yay!

30:00.100 --> 30:01.460
I, Mimi, have reached the top!

30:03.460 --> 30:04.380
The top!

30:05.940 --> 30:06.740
I want to eat that.

30:06.740 --> 30:07.900
Want to join them, Zhangzhu?

30:10.340 --> 30:10.700
No.

30:11.660 --> 30:13.940
I just didn't expect He Han to be so...

30:14.780 --> 30:15.340
Cheesy?

30:16.700 --> 30:18.820
No, just different from what I imagined.

30:22.780 --> 30:24.620
I didn't expect you to be so young.

30:24.620 --> 30:25.377
How old are you?

30:25.860 --> 30:26.380
Twenty-six.

30:27.460 --> 30:28.311
I'm twenty-two.

30:29.020 --> 30:29.380
Okay.

30:31.860 --> 30:33.580
You don't seem to talk much.

30:34.300 --> 30:35.340
Why do your characters

30:35.340 --> 30:36.260
talk so much?

30:37.380 --> 30:38.540
Isn't it true that authors

30:39.660 --> 30:40.620
give their protagonists

30:40.860 --> 30:42.220
whatever they lack themselves?

30:43.260 --> 30:44.060
Wish fulfillment.

30:45.660 --> 30:46.540
Lean back.

30:47.060 --> 30:47.500
Lean back.

30:48.711 --> 30:49.733
I'll lean back too.

30:49.860 --> 30:50.600
I'll do it too.

30:51.380 --> 30:52.660
So, do you read He Han's novels?

30:53.900 --> 30:54.220
I have.

30:54.220 --> 30:55.111
What do you think?

30:56.700 --> 30:57.420
I feel like

30:58.700 --> 30:59.800
I'm the better writer.

31:00.340 --> 31:01.220
In a month,

31:01.700 --> 31:02.620
I might surpass him.

31:04.740 --> 31:05.688
I admire your spirit.

31:06.060 --> 31:06.900
No one has ever dared

31:06.900 --> 31:08.180
to challenge He Han before.

31:08.777 --> 31:09.300
Good luck.

31:14.700 --> 31:15.220
What?

31:16.100 --> 31:17.140
You went into my bedroom?

31:22.860 --> 31:24.380
I didn't go in there on purpose.

31:24.380 --> 31:25.580
I just couldn't find my stuff,

31:25.580 --> 31:26.940
so I went in to look.

31:26.940 --> 31:28.060
That's still not okay.

31:29.140 --> 31:30.780
But there's no one else in your room,

31:30.780 --> 31:32.060
and you have nothing to hide.

31:32.220 --> 31:33.420
Why do you care so much?

31:33.900 --> 31:35.740
It's not about what's in my bedroom.

31:35.740 --> 31:37.540
It's about you breaking our agreement.

31:43.660 --> 31:44.740
Fine, I was wrong.

31:45.140 --> 31:46.540
I won't do it again, okay?

31:46.780 --> 31:47.660
There is no "again."

31:48.860 --> 31:49.980
Do you not love me anymore?

31:50.140 --> 31:50.540
I don't.

31:53.380 --> 31:54.740
You said you loved me.

31:54.740 --> 31:56.620
That you'd make me
incredibly successful.

31:57.060 --> 31:58.140
You've reached the top.

31:58.140 --> 31:59.140
Isn't that enough?

31:59.980 --> 32:00.740
But you said

32:01.460 --> 32:02.700
you loved me the most.

32:02.700 --> 32:04.060
And that you were going to marry me.

32:04.060 --> 32:05.020
You said you'd accept

32:05.020 --> 32:06.210
all my flaws.

32:06.210 --> 32:07.100
I absolutely did not.

32:07.222 --> 32:09.020
That's what the male lead
in your novel said.

32:09.140 --> 32:09.700
Not me.

32:09.700 --> 32:11.140
The male lead is you!

32:11.140 --> 32:12.220
And I'm the female lead!

32:12.220 --> 32:13.540
You decided that on your own.

32:17.900 --> 32:18.700
What do you mean?

32:21.460 --> 32:22.060
I think

32:24.380 --> 32:25.260
we should break up.

32:32.380 --> 32:33.220
He Han...

32:36.380 --> 32:36.940
He Han!

32:36.940 --> 32:38.780
Why would you dump me

32:38.780 --> 32:40.100
right at my peak?

32:40.260 --> 32:42.500
Wouldn't it be worse
to dump you at your lowest?

33:00.300 --> 33:01.860
Oh my god. That's so humiliating.

33:04.620 --> 33:05.740
Don't worry. He's fine.

33:06.533 --> 33:07.444
He's used to it.

33:07.820 --> 33:08.900
You think that's fine?

33:09.340 --> 33:11.260
It might bother someone else, but

33:11.980 --> 33:13.460
he's probably enjoying it.

33:29.260 --> 33:30.500
Looks like my luck is bad too.

33:32.060 --> 33:32.740
Sorry about that.

33:33.020 --> 33:33.860
Did I scare you?

33:34.860 --> 33:36.180
We're having a work meeting here.

33:36.500 --> 33:37.340
It's not a good time.

33:37.420 --> 33:38.580
That's okay. I don't mind.

33:43.220 --> 33:44.940
What was my junior's pen name again?

33:45.380 --> 33:46.540
Return of the Phantom Knight?

33:47.333 --> 33:49.300
The Phantom Knight
stopped writing ages ago.

33:49.300 --> 33:50.220
How did he return?

33:51.222 --> 33:52.400
Just paying tribute.

33:52.940 --> 33:54.340
Even though his writing

33:54.622 --> 33:56.340
falls far short compared to the original

33:56.340 --> 33:57.260
Phantom Knight,

33:57.820 --> 33:58.980
it still has its moments.

33:59.700 --> 34:01.140
I've heard of the Phantom Knight.

34:01.311 --> 34:02.300
He can be considered

34:02.300 --> 34:04.100
the founding father of online fiction.

34:04.420 --> 34:05.060
But later on,

34:05.300 --> 34:06.460
he suddenly stopped writing.

34:07.140 --> 34:07.780
Back then,

34:07.780 --> 34:09.300
online authors didn't use real names.

34:09.700 --> 34:12.380
So no one knows who he really is.

34:12.940 --> 34:13.860
I just figured

34:14.460 --> 34:15.580
that borrowing his name

34:15.660 --> 34:17.060
wouldn't cause any trouble.

34:17.780 --> 34:18.780
Mr. He, Ms. Lin.

34:19.244 --> 34:20.060
You're experienced.

34:20.060 --> 34:21.370
Have you ever met Phantom Knight?

34:21.370 --> 34:22.177
- No.
- No.

34:23.020 --> 34:23.940
If he came back,

34:23.940 --> 34:25.100
all of us could stop writing.

34:25.380 --> 34:26.340
Seriously.

34:26.340 --> 34:27.220
We'd be sent packing.

34:28.260 --> 34:29.740
That was over a decade ago.

34:30.140 --> 34:31.133
If he really came back,

34:31.740 --> 34:32.540
I could still win.

34:33.200 --> 34:35.688
Just focus on getting over
the hill in front of you first.

34:38.740 --> 34:39.180
Alright.

34:39.540 --> 34:40.380
Take your time.

34:40.700 --> 34:41.380
I'm taking off.

34:45.940 --> 34:46.980
Only twenty days left

34:47.100 --> 34:47.940
until the deadline.

34:48.740 --> 34:49.700
Keep at it, Junior.

34:49.700 --> 34:50.620
Make our mentor proud.

35:01.060 --> 35:01.500
Well?

35:01.733 --> 35:02.820
Did the idol's true color

35:03.260 --> 35:03.740
hurt you?

35:05.060 --> 35:06.660
Don't you think he's super cute?

35:16.740 --> 35:18.340
(Hello, everyone, I'm Mimi!)

35:18.700 --> 35:20.900
(Today is a day of double blessings.)

35:20.933 --> 35:21.730
(The first is that)

35:21.730 --> 35:23.620
(Fans lining up)
("Love-Obsessed Husband" has reached)

35:23.620 --> 35:25.888
(Number one fan is here)
(the top of the women's chart!)

35:26.060 --> 35:27.580
(Thank you all for your love.)

35:27.860 --> 35:29.940
(And thank you
for your ongoing support.)

35:30.140 --> 35:31.420
(I will continue to write)

35:31.420 --> 35:32.620
(many more great stories.)

35:32.780 --> 35:34.300
(Please look forward to them.)

35:34.333 --> 35:34.980
(I love you guys!)

35:37.200 --> 35:38.600
(Who is this?)
(The second is that)

35:38.660 --> 35:40.980
(A new work?)
(I finally saw him for who he truly is)

35:41.022 --> 35:42.466
(What are we talking about?)
(and I dumped him!)

35:45.580 --> 35:47.620
Do you think it's worth it for He Han?

35:47.822 --> 35:48.740
He helped her succeed

35:48.740 --> 35:50.180
only to get publicly trashed.

35:50.940 --> 35:51.940
Mimi leaves,

35:51.940 --> 35:54.022
and another Lily
or Niuniu will take her place.

35:54.780 --> 35:55.620
They know the deal.

35:55.700 --> 35:56.780
As long as they date him,

35:56.860 --> 35:58.420
their novels will shoot up the charts.

35:58.780 --> 35:59.660
Plenty are willing.

36:00.180 --> 36:01.260
But honestly,

36:02.260 --> 36:03.140
if he dates

36:03.140 --> 36:04.380
only one girlfriend for a while,

36:04.380 --> 36:06.140
breaks up, and then dates the next,

36:06.380 --> 36:07.340
it's fine.

36:08.140 --> 36:09.100
And he genuinely

36:09.100 --> 36:10.660
helps each girlfriend get on the charts.

36:11.220 --> 36:12.660
In a sense,

36:13.260 --> 36:15.060
that makes him a high-quality boyfriend.

36:26.580 --> 36:27.740
He met Gu Yan today.

36:30.380 --> 36:31.140
Was it tense?

36:31.860 --> 36:32.820
He's jealous of Gu Yan.

36:33.580 --> 36:34.340
I could tell.

36:35.620 --> 36:36.260
Tell the truth,

36:36.555 --> 36:38.111
is Gu Yan your little boyfriend?

36:38.220 --> 36:38.700
No.

36:39.333 --> 36:41.180
It's just an author-editor relationship.

36:41.460 --> 36:42.980
An author and editor

36:42.980 --> 36:44.500
can be boyfriend and girlfriend too.

36:44.977 --> 36:46.222
It's better not to be.

36:47.100 --> 36:48.340
Do you regret breaking up

36:48.420 --> 36:49.180
with He Han?

36:49.540 --> 36:50.340
Regret what?

36:51.244 --> 36:52.260
If we hadn't broken up,

36:52.533 --> 36:53.660
Gu Yan wouldn't have been

36:53.660 --> 36:55.020
forced into the spotlight,

36:55.511 --> 36:57.260
and wouldn't be
an overnight success now.

36:57.500 --> 36:58.860
I didn't mean professionally.

36:59.220 --> 37:00.311
You mean his character?

37:02.540 --> 37:03.460
Just two words.

37:04.380 --> 37:04.900
Selfish.

37:05.700 --> 37:06.377
Narcissistic.

37:08.340 --> 37:09.420
He Han still loves you.

37:11.660 --> 37:13.060
At least, I think he still does.

37:29.060 --> 37:29.700
He said

37:30.460 --> 37:31.340
he loves me.

37:33.140 --> 37:34.060
But everyone

37:35.220 --> 37:36.580
expresses love differently.

37:40.100 --> 37:41.140
He says he loves me.

37:42.340 --> 37:43.980
But he can't share his life with me

37:44.580 --> 37:45.940
long-term and stably.

37:52.700 --> 37:53.740
He writes so many novels,

37:55.300 --> 37:56.740
and he really thinks he's trapped in

37:56.940 --> 37:58.690
some tragic past life memory

37:58.690 --> 37:59.711
that he can't reveal.

38:00.300 --> 38:02.180
That he has to stay away
from the mortal world

38:03.220 --> 38:04.140
and worldly love.

38:04.500 --> 38:05.340
Otherwise,

38:05.420 --> 38:07.240
he'll drag
everyone around him down to ashes,

38:07.340 --> 38:09.140
or even send them
to eternal damnation.

38:11.100 --> 38:12.020
But stories like that

38:12.020 --> 38:13.540
only fool young girls.

38:14.140 --> 38:16.180
I have produced
hundreds of stories like that.

38:17.540 --> 38:18.460
I don't buy it.

38:24.466 --> 38:25.860
Please give this to Lawyer Bei.

38:26.400 --> 38:27.900
It's Chenxing's contract with Gu Yan.

38:28.500 --> 38:29.900
I want the terms to be more binding.

38:30.740 --> 38:31.260
Why?

38:31.740 --> 38:32.580
Don't you trust him?

38:33.420 --> 38:35.220
He seems like an honest young man.

38:35.300 --> 38:37.180
That's because
he hasn't met enough people,

38:37.260 --> 38:38.580
and temptations yet.

38:39.860 --> 38:40.500
But, you know,

38:42.900 --> 38:43.820
people change.

38:46.940 --> 38:48.180
(Questionnaire)

38:48.180 --> 38:48.820
Are you done?

38:51.022 --> 38:52.666
There are hundreds of questions.

38:53.620 --> 38:55.380
And you paid a thousand yuan for them?

38:56.300 --> 38:57.180
I could have

38:57.460 --> 38:58.260
taken you to a bar

38:58.260 --> 38:59.266
for five hundred yuan.

39:00.740 --> 39:02.380
This does precision matching.

39:02.980 --> 39:04.260
The guys you meet at bars

39:04.660 --> 39:05.980
are just lonely and looking for

39:05.980 --> 39:06.940
a good time.

39:08.860 --> 39:10.060
So you spend a thousand,

39:10.420 --> 39:11.220
and that guarantees

39:11.220 --> 39:12.580
they want a serious relationship?

39:12.980 --> 39:14.300
He Han spent more on you.

39:15.940 --> 39:16.711
It's different.

39:17.540 --> 39:19.180
This ensures our values align.

39:22.140 --> 39:23.060
Look at this question.

39:24.180 --> 39:25.355
"Do you think that love

39:25.820 --> 39:28.500
requires being together day and night?"

39:29.940 --> 39:31.620
My answer is definitely yes.

39:32.820 --> 39:34.380
In "The Return of the Condor Heroes",

39:34.700 --> 39:35.460
a husband

39:35.660 --> 39:37.577
is only a husband
if he's within arm's reach.

39:37.822 --> 39:39.460
So the system
will definitely match me

39:39.460 --> 39:40.540
with someone who answered

39:40.540 --> 39:41.820
similarly to me on this question.

39:42.620 --> 39:43.540
Someone like He Han

39:43.900 --> 39:45.580
would obviously never enter my system.

39:46.340 --> 39:47.900
There was a performance art piece.

39:48.420 --> 39:49.900
A woman tied herself to her boyfriend

39:49.900 --> 39:50.700
for a month.

39:51.260 --> 39:53.100
Then, they never
spoke to each other again.

39:53.244 --> 39:55.044
We don't have to be tied together.

39:55.488 --> 39:56.380
At the very least,

39:56.380 --> 39:57.980
he shouldn't ban me from his bedroom.

40:11.460 --> 40:13.300
I need to pray
to my almighty toothbrush.

40:18.140 --> 40:19.060
Clear the clouds.

40:19.844 --> 40:21.111
Bring me true love.

40:21.155 --> 40:22.220
After you finish the test,

40:22.220 --> 40:23.740
how soon do they deliver your true love?

40:24.220 --> 40:25.060
One business day

40:25.377 --> 40:26.420
for the review results.

40:30.100 --> 40:32.980
♪Died a little inside last night♪

40:33.180 --> 40:36.220
♪Cause I'll never see you again♪

40:37.860 --> 40:40.980
♪I'm waking up to silence around me♪

40:41.620 --> 40:44.340
♪Heal, can I heal?♪

40:46.100 --> 40:49.100
♪All I want is nothing more♪

40:50.060 --> 40:51.900
(Please update, He Han! I'm begging you!
A month is just way too long!)

40:51.900 --> 40:53.060
(Why pause updates for a month?)

40:53.100 --> 40:57.060
♪I don't wanna leave the memories♪

40:58.820 --> 41:03.460
(Zhangzhu: Gu Yan is no threat.
He Han is the GOAT.)

41:05.180 --> 41:09.820
♪The way to forget you♪

41:10.660 --> 41:14.260
♪Never forget you♪

41:31.820 --> 41:34.860
(Colorful Culture Media)

41:53.100 --> 41:54.060
Wu Jian called.

41:55.220 --> 41:56.220
Zhiyuan decided to invest

41:56.500 --> 41:57.260
in Chenxing.

41:57.780 --> 41:59.020
They are making a bigger splash.

42:05.140 --> 42:06.540
Do you know how much this office

42:08.020 --> 42:09.020
costs a month?

42:10.200 --> 42:11.377
What are you getting at?

42:11.620 --> 42:12.820
Bringing in a new partner

42:13.980 --> 42:14.740
would relieve

42:14.860 --> 42:15.660
the pressure on us.

42:16.260 --> 42:16.980
A female partner?

42:20.155 --> 42:22.020
She brings in
well-known traditional authors,

42:22.020 --> 42:23.900
and a ten-million investment.
Isn't that good?

42:28.180 --> 42:28.900
What's her name?

42:29.540 --> 42:30.180
Qiao Qiao.

42:37.340 --> 42:37.740
Her?

42:45.140 --> 42:45.700
I disagree.

42:46.420 --> 42:47.700
Find me a ten-million investment,

42:48.580 --> 42:49.940
and then you get to disagree.

42:56.340 --> 42:59.940
(Qiao Qiao, Publisher & Author)

43:04.800 --> 43:06.660
There are many authors
with good attitudes,

43:06.660 --> 43:09.020
but a top-ranked author
as helpful as you?

43:09.220 --> 43:10.060
You're the first.

43:10.060 --> 43:11.100
Per your requirements,

43:11.177 --> 43:12.466
I've made detailed provisions.

43:12.555 --> 43:13.920
You don't even need to be present.

43:13.933 --> 43:15.355
I can negotiate with him privately.

43:15.444 --> 43:16.950
Have you looked over these contracts?

43:16.980 --> 43:17.700
I've seen them.

43:18.020 --> 43:19.660
If you've seen them, I'll just sign.

43:20.260 --> 43:21.620
(If what He Han troubled me with)

43:21.900 --> 43:23.420
(was an unplaceable lightness,)

43:24.140 --> 43:25.940
(what Gu Yan is forcing on me now)

43:26.940 --> 43:28.500
(is an unbearable weight.)

43:30.441 --> 43:31.561
(I've been thinking.)

43:32.841 --> 43:36.121
(Everyone's most comfortable level of intimacy)

43:36.881 --> 43:44.211
(is probably different.)

43:45.211 --> 43:46.961
♪If the sky♪

43:47.471 --> 43:48.871
♪And the sea♪

43:49.411 --> 43:51.121
♪Turned upside down♪

43:52.681 --> 43:54.611
♪If a swimming fish♪

43:55.011 --> 43:58.401
♪Fell in love with a flying bird♪

44:00.171 --> 44:02.141
♪If back then♪

44:02.501 --> 44:06.911
♪We had never let go♪

44:07.511 --> 44:13.791
♪We wouldn't be lost in the crowd♪

44:14.911 --> 44:17.061
♪We met in a thirteenth month♪

44:17.061 --> 44:18.931
♪Held each other in a fifth season♪

44:19.111 --> 44:21.551
♪And found our way back whole♪

44:22.391 --> 44:24.561
♪So let this surging love♪

44:24.561 --> 44:28.991
♪Rise like tides that never fall♪

44:29.891 --> 44:32.071
♪If we're caught in a pouring rain♪

44:32.071 --> 44:33.161
♪That's alright♪

44:33.701 --> 44:34.451
♪If we're buried♪

44:34.451 --> 44:37.151
♪By passing years all the better♪

44:37.411 --> 44:39.591
♪At least we still can keep♪

44:39.771 --> 44:44.191
♪This one eternal photograph♪

44:59.951 --> 45:02.241
♪We're on misaligned tracks♪

45:02.241 --> 45:04.001
♪Running in opposite ways♪

45:04.121 --> 45:06.591
♪Searching all along the way♪

45:07.391 --> 45:09.551
♪For the fire of our younger hearts♪

45:09.741 --> 45:14.651
♪And the beauty lost in time♪

45:14.651 --> 45:18.171
♪This time don't lose each other again♪

45:18.411 --> 45:19.381
♪Only after loss♪

45:19.381 --> 45:22.011
♪Do we learn what truly matters most♪

45:22.421 --> 45:24.781
♪In another time and space♪

45:24.781 --> 45:26.341
♪We'll stay and walk together♪

45:26.341 --> 45:29.171
♪Till we grow old♪

45:30.131 --> 45:32.421
♪But still the sky will never♪

45:32.421 --> 45:35.091
♪Turn with the sea♪

45:37.611 --> 45:40.021
♪But still a swimming fish won't♪

45:40.021 --> 45:45.231
♪Fall in love with a flying bird♪
